  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto is currently in Manila attending the 49th ASEAN Summit and associated regional meetings, including the ASEAN-Japan and ASEAN-US summits. During the proceedings, the President emphasized Indonesia's commitment to energy security through large-scale solar power initiatives and the B50 biofuel program. Beyond energy, he has urged ASEAN to evolve beyond a consumer market into a significant technology industrial power while calling for improved cooperation to combat transnational crime. The summit has drawn significant international attention with the arrival of other world leaders, such as Donald Trump, for US-ASEAN talks. These sessions have been accompanied by public demonstrations in Manila. Prabowo has further utilized the diplomatic venue to engage with various counterparts, including a notable meeting with Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi, while reaffirming Indonesia's stance on regional stability and peacekeeping capabilities.",
